  "prefLabel": "Ins 1903.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1903.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to assure the orderly implementation and conversion of medicare supplement insurance benefits and premiums due to changes in the federal medicare program.\n\nSource. #4553, eff 12-7-88; ss by #5656, eff 7-1-93; ss by #7017, INTERIM, eff 7-1-99, EXPIRED: 10-29-99\n\nNew. #8556, eff 2-1-06, EXPIRED: 2-1-14",
